      <title>黑客攻击后，币安的市场份额保持稳定： - 持仓量：44.9% → 43.8% - ±1% 订单深度：前</title>
      <link>https://x.com/coinglass_com/status/2125183103538770124</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;黑客攻击后，币安的市场份额保持稳定：&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- 持仓量：44.9% → 43.8%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- ±1% 订单深度：前后约 55%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- 衍生品交易量：51.3% → 51.2%（暂停提款时为 50.9%）&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;完整报告👇&lt;br/&gt;https://www.coinglass.com/learn/facts-after-the-hack-20261118-67c938477a90935f-en&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance&amp;#x27;s market share held steady after the hack:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Open interest: 44.9% → 43.8%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- ±1% order book depth: ~55% before and after&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Derivatives volume: 51.3% → 51.2% (50.9% with withdrawals paused)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Full report 👇&lt;br/&gt;https://www.coinglass.com/learn/facts-after-the-hack-20261118-67c938477a90935f-en&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;黑客攻击后，币安的市场份额保持稳定：&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- 持仓量：44.9% → 43.8%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- ±1% 订单深度：前后约 55%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- 衍生品交易量：51.3% → 51.2%（暂停提款时为 50.9%）&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;完整报告👇&lt;br/&gt;https://www.coinglass.com/learn/facts-after-the-hack-20261118-67c938477a90935f-en&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance&amp;#x27;s market share held steady after the hack:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Open interest: 44.9% → 43.8%&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- ±1% order book depth: ~55% before and after&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Derivatives volume: 51.3% → 51.2% (50.9% with withdrawals paused)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Full report 👇&lt;br/&gt;https://www.coinglass.com/learn/facts-after-the-hack-20261118-67c938477a90935f-en&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded>
